# When the container does not supply the "iv-user" request header (no WebSEAL in front of the
# app), set a user id here. AccessManagementFilter then injects that value as the iv-user header
# for every request, so the whole application sees a logged-in user with no other change.
# The injected user is given a hardcoded PROFILE (display name, locales, mapped roles) instead
